      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was pretty surprised to see these weren't exposed when I started working with Udon recently, would be very nice to have. There are a couple ways I know to do \"global shader variables\" without these functions, but neither is ideal. You can either pipe in a rendertexture to each applicable shader, or manually update shader properties with a script. Both can have a significant performance impact if done with enough materials, though.",
